# Per-item sidecars written by the publish pipeline. Shape: `.<8-hex>.hash`
# and `.pub-*` (see docs/sidecars.md). Transient — regenerated on every
# publish, never authoritative. Anchored under any `targets/` dir so we
# don't accidentally swallow legitimate dotfiles elsewhere.
**/targets/**/.[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].hash
**/targets/**/.pub-*

# Reverse-dep indices — derived from page/fragment manifests, rebuilt
# on save / publish / reindex CLI. Live under `.gazetta/{asset-refs,
# fragment-deps}/`. Targets carry their own copy; we don't commit the
# source-side editable target's copy either.
**/targets/**/.gazetta/asset-refs/
**/targets/**/.gazetta/fragment-deps/
